                                                  1458 *        i4=204 (nv=1, nz=1, //, so=11, pc=0, sv=0)
                                                  1459 *        i4=206 (nv=1, nz=1, //, so=11, pc=1, sv=0)
                                                  1460
                                                  1461 * m5 tests (note: cs is always 1)
                                                  1462 *                                   m5=1  (cs=1)
                                                  1463 *
                                                  1464 * z/Architecture Principles of Operation, SA22-7832-12.
                                                  1465 * Figure 25-4. Operation of VECTOR PERFORM SIGN OPERATION DECIMAL
                                                  1466 * tests
                                                  1467 *
                                                  1468 *------------------------------------------------
                                                  1469 * SC=00 (maintain): nv=1 to avoid data exceptions
